Rule 3 (for real-valued tensors, avoid NaNs by requiring non-negative elements)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if (dtype_(v_1) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8) then min(v_1) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 4 (tensor has valid (non-negative) dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
